      <section class="text-panel">
        <p class="eyebrow">Status</p>
        <h1>Mosvera has no hosted runtime dependency.</h1>
        <p>
          Mosvera production usage runs inside user-owned tools, local
          registries, package installs, and MCP hosts. This website hosts
          documentation, schemas, example packs, and the live demonstrator.
        </p>
        <p>
          Public availability depends on GitHub, npm, PyPI, and the static
          Vercel deployment for <code>mosvera.io</code>.
        </p>
        <p>
          For a runtime/package issue, open an issue in the affected repository.
          For security issues, use <a href="/security">the security policy</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </main>
